WHAT THIS IS
Orion is an ownerless randomness protocol for Arc (Circle's L1, native gas token is USDC). A smart contract asks the hub for a random number and attaches a USDC reward. The number comes from the public drand beacon (network "evmnet", BN254 BLS signatures, 3-second rounds). The hub verifies the beacon signature onchain, so nobody can predict or choose the result. Anyone can run a relayer bot to deliver signatures and collect the reward. The hub has no owner, no pause, no upgrade path and no protocol fee. Solidity 0.8.28, Foundry, OpenZeppelin 5.6.1, @kevincharm/bls-bn254 2.0.0.

The contracts are named RandomnessHub, RandomnessConsumer, RandomnessDemo and IRandomnessHub. "Orion" is the product name.

